<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Clawed Hands</ansi> mutation

Your fingernails fuse and harden into rending claws. Formidable in
combat, unsettling to behold.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Powerful natural weapons for unarmed combat — your claws deal
  serious damage without any equipment

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Significantly reduced charisma — the dark, curved claws are
  deeply off-putting to most people

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Extra Arms, Toxic Bite

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
